     "create_time": 1790503380.123456,
     "update_time": null,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "Use `sorted()` with a **key function**. Dicts can't be compared with each other, which is why `sorted(data)` raises *TypeError*.\n\n```python\nfrom operator import itemgetter\n\nby_age = sorted(people, key=itemgetter(\"age\"))\n```\n\n### Complexity\n\nTimsort: $O(n \\log n)$ in the worst case."
      ]
     },
     "status": "finished_successfully",
     "end_turn": true,
     "weight": 1,
     "metadata": {},
     "recipient": "all",
     "channel": null
    },
